{"type":"message","id":"5f222d1a","parentId":"48830ad1","timestamp":"2026-02-18T13:18:14.449Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! I got output from the script when using pty=true. The investigation reveals:\n\n1. **Scheduled tasks**: The script didn't output any tasks because the schtasks command didn't return anything in the initial runs. Let me check that more carefully. The script's first section just did `schtasks /query /fo LIST /v 2>&1` and then tried to find \"openclaw|gateway\". It didn't output anything, which means either:\n   - schtasks returned nothing (no tasks)\n   - or the output didn't contain those keywords\n   I should modify the script to output the raw tasks first to see what's there.\n\n2. **Startup folders**: \n   - User startup: C:\\Users\\mangs\\AppData\\Roaming\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Start Menu\\Programs\\Startup\n     Contains: Comet.lnk, desktop.ini, Send to OneNote.lnk, ShareX.lnk\n   - Common startup: C:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Start Menu\\Programs\\Startup\n     Contains: desktop.ini only\n   None of these appear to be OpenClaw related.\n\n3. **Registry Run Keys**:\n   HKLM:\n     - SecurityHealth\n     - PDF24\n     - MTPW (MiniTool Partition Wizard)\n   HKCU:\n     - OneDrive\n     - Microsoft.Lists\n     - Ditto\n     - Unified Remote V3\n     - Teams\n     - Claude\n     - Docker Desktop\n   None appear to be OpenClaw or gateway related.\n\n4. **OpenClawGateway service**: NOT FOUND. So the service is not installed or has been removed.\n\n5. **Running processes**: No openclaw or gateway processes found.\n\n6. **Event Logs**: No relevant events found.\n\n7. **Watchdog Scripts**: The script had an error trying to search for scripts. I'll fix that.\n\nSo far, I haven't found any evidence of OpenClaw or gateway. But the user reports a recurring console window flicker, which suggests something is trying to start a gateway repeatedly. \n\nI need to dig deeper and expand my search parameters to uncover potential hidden triggers. A more comprehensive investigation might reveal something that was previously missed.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"I got some output! Let me refine the investigation. I see that the OpenClawGateway service is NOT found, and no processes are running. Let me now get the full scheduled tasks list to see if there's something else triggering the restarts, and also check for any scripts that might be launching the gateway."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e4da7281e4d140f58da90d42","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# OpenClaw Gateway Investigation - Detailed\nWrite-Host \"=== FULL SCHEDULED TASKS LIST ===\"\ntry {\n    $tasks = schtasks /query /fo LIST /v 2>&1\n    if ($tasks) {\n        # Save to file for easier viewing\n        $tasks | Out-File \"$env:TEMP\\all_scheduled_tasks.txt\" -Force\n        Write-Host \"All tasks saved to: $env:TEMP\\all_scheduled_tasks.txt\"\n        Write-Host \"`nSearching for 'openclaw' or 'gateway'...\"\n        $tasks | Select-String -Pattern \"openclaw|gateway\" -CaseSensitive:$false\n    } else {\n        Write-Host \"schtasks returned no output.\"\n    }\n} catch {\n    Write-Host \"Error: $_\"\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== CHECKING TASK SCHEDULER LIBRARY FOLDER ===\"\n$taskPath = \"C:\\Windows\\System32\\Tasks\"\nif (Test-Path $taskPath) {\n    Write-Host \"Looking for tasks with 'openclaw' or 'gateway' in name...\"\n    Get-ChildItem -Path $taskPath -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | \n        Where-Object { $_.Name -like \"*openclaw*\" -or $_.Name -like \"*gateway*\" } |\n        Select-Object FullName, Name\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== CHECKING ALL STARTUP FILES ===\"\n$startupPaths = @(\n    \"$env:APPDATA\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Start Menu\\Programs\\Startup\",\n    \"$env:ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Start Menu\\Programs\\Startup\"\n)\nforeach ($path in $startupPaths) {\n    if (Test-Path $path) {\n        Write-Host \"`nStartup folder: $path\"\n        Get-ChildItem $path -Force | ForEach-Object {\n            $target = $null\n            if ($_.Extension -eq \".lnk\") {\n                try {\n                    $shell = New-Object -ComObject WScript.Shell\n                    $shortcut = $shell.CreateShortcut($_.FullName)\n                    $target = $shortcut.TargetPath\n                } catch { $target = \"Error reading shortcut\" }\n            }\n            [PSCustomObject]@{\n                Name = $_.Name\n                Type = $_.Extension\n                Target = $target\n                FullName = $_.FullName\n            }\n        } | Format-Table -AutoSize\n    }\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== CHECKING ALL REGISTRY RUN KEYS (INCLUDING EXPANDED) ===\"\n$regPaths = @(\n    \"HKLM:\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run\",\n    \"HKLM:\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\RunOnce\",\n    \"HKLM:\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\RunOnceEx\",\n    \"HKCU:\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run\",\n    \"HKCU:\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\RunOnce\",\n    \"HKLM:\\Software\\Wow6432Node\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run\",\n    \"HKLM:\\Software\\Wow6432Node\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\RunOnce\"\n)\nforeach ($regPath in $regPaths) {\n    if (Test-Path $regPath) {\n        Write-Host \"`nRegistry: $regPath\"\n        try {\n            $props = Get-ItemProperty -Path $regPath -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n            if ($props) {\n                $props.PSObject.Properties | \n                    Where-Object {$_.Name -notmatch \"^(PSPath|PSParentPath|PSChildName|PSDrive|PSProvider)$\"} |\n                    ForEach-Object {\n                        [PSCustomObject]@{\n                            Name = $_.Name\n                            Value = $_.Value\n                        }\n                    } | Format-Table -AutoSize\n            } else {\n                Write-Host \"(Empty)\"\n            }\n        } catch {\n            Write-Host \"(Error: $_)\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== SEARCHING FOR WATCHDOG/BATCH SCRIPTS ===\"\n$searchDirs = @(\n    \"$env:USERPROFILE\\Documents\",\n    \"$env:USERPROFILE\\Desktop\",\n    \"$env:USERPROFILE\\Downloads\",\n    \"$env:ProgramData\",\n    \"C:\\Scripts\",\n    \"C:\\Tasks\",\n    \"C:\\Windows\\System32\\Tasks\",\n    \"D:\\\"\n)\n$scriptExtensions = @('*.ps1','*.bat','*.cmd','*.vbs','*.js','*.wsf')\nforeach ($dir in $searchDirs) {\n    if (Test-Path $dir) {\n        Write-Host \"`nScanning: $dir\"\n        foreach ($ext in $scriptExtensions) {\n            try {\n                $files = Get-ChildItem -Path $dir -Filter $ext -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | \n                    Where-Object { $_.Name -like \"*openclaw*\" -or $_.Name -like \"*gateway*\" } |\n                    Select-Object FullName, Name, Length\n                if ($files) {\n                    $files | Format-Table -AutoSize\n                }\n            } catch { }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== CHECKING FOR GATEWAY-RELATED FILES ===\"\n$possiblePaths = @(\n    \"C:\\Program Files\\OpenClaw\",\n    \"C:\\Program Files (x86)\\OpenClaw\",\n    \"$env:LOCALAPPDATA\\OpenClaw\",\n    \"$env:APPDATA\\OpenClaw\",\n    \"D:\\OpenClaw\"\n)\nforeach ($path in $possiblePaths) {\n    if (Test-Path $path) {\n        Write-Host \"`nFound directory: $path\"\n        Get-ChildItem $path -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | \n            Where-Object { $_.Name -like \"*gateway*\" -or $_.Name -like \"*openclaw*\" } |\n            Select-Object FullName, Length, LastWriteTime | Format-Table -AutoSize\n    }\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== CHECKING WINDOWS SERVICES (ALL) ===\"\ntry {\n    $services = Get-Service | Where-Object {$_.Name -like \"*openclaw*\" -or $_.Name -like \"*gateway*\"} | Select-Object Name, DisplayName, Status, StartType\n    if ($services) {\n        $services | Format-Table -AutoSize\n    } else {\n        Write-Host \"No services found with those keywords.\"\n    }\n} catch { Write-Host \"Error: $_\" }\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== CHECKING FOR ACTIVE CONSOLE WINDOWS ===\"\ntry {\n    $consoleWindows = Get-Process | Where-Object { $_.MainWindowTitle -like \"*openclaw*\" -or $_.MainWindowTitle -like \"*gateway*\" -or $_.ProcessName -like \"cmd*\" } | Select-Object Id, ProcessName, MainWindowTitle\n    if ($consoleWindows) {\n        Write-Host \"Found relevant console windows:\"\n        $consoleWindows | Format-Table -AutoSize\n    } else {\n        Write-Host \"No console windows with those titles found.\"\n    }\n} catch { Write-Host \"Error: $_\" }\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== INVESTIGATION COMPLETE ===\"\nWrite-Host \"Review the output above and check $env:TEMP\\all_scheduled_tasks.txt for full task list.\"\n","file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\.openclaw-state\\workspace-coder2\\investigate_gateway_detailed.ps1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":17083,"output":2767,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19850,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771420668710}}
