{"type":"message","id":"52ddada0","parentId":"3b1683fc","timestamp":"2026-02-18T13:25:14.919Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The scripts are having issues with the PowerShell syntax (the dot notation). I need to be careful. But maybe I should take a step back. The core issue: I need to find what's causing the console window flicker. I found an active window titled \"openclaw-tui\". That suggests something is running the openclaw CLI in a TUI mode, and the window might be flickering because it's being restarted repeatedly. The process ID 22972 is a PowerShell process that likely runs openclaw with some arguments that set the window title to \"openclaw-tui\". I need to find the parent process or the script that launched it.\n\nI can check the process's parent process ID (PPID) using Get-CimInstance again. Also, I can check the command line arguments more carefully.\n\nMaybe I can use WMI to get the full command line, including the title if it was set via `$host.ui.RawUI.WindowTitle`. But that wouldn't be in the command line. So the title \"openclaw-tui\" is likely set by the script itself. So the launching command might simply be `powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File some-script.ps1` or `openclaw some-command`.\n\nLet me find out what is the command that launched process 22972. I'll use Get-CimInstance to get the command line correctly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me get more details about the openclaw-tui process by checking its parent and full command line using a simpler method:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_89fa257bd984415793749508","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"$targetPid = 22972\n$proc = Get-CimInstance Win32_Process -Filter \"ProcessId = $targetPid\"\nif ($proc) {\n    $ppid = $proc.ParentProcessId\n    $parent = Get-CimInstance Win32_Process -Filter \"ProcessId = $ppid\"\n    [PSCustomObject]@{\n        ProcessId = $proc.ProcessId\n        ParentProcessId = $ppid\n        ParentName = if ($parent) { $parent.Name } else { 'N/A' }\n        ParentCommand = if ($parent) { $parent.CommandLine } else { 'N/A' }\n        CommandLine = $proc.CommandLine\n        Name = $proc.Name\n    } | Format-List\n} else {\n    Write-Host \"Process $targetPid not found\"\n}\n","file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\.openclaw-state\\workspace-coder2\\get_process_tree.ps1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":102952,"output":873,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103825,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771421105667}}
