{"type":"message","id":"db4628f3","parentId":"72670abc","timestamp":"2026-02-18T13:26:12.110Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! The shortcut points to `D:\\workspace\\appDev\\clawdbot\\clawdbot\\launch_openclaw.bat`. That batch file likely launches the OpenClaw gateway/TUI. Let's read that batch file.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"We found the culprit! The desktop shortcut `OpenClaw.lnk` points to a batch file that launches OpenClaw. Let's examine it:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3ba92fdb197a4005b3c601bc","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\clawdbot\\clawdbot\\launch_openclaw.bat"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":105317,"output":178,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105495,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771421164147}}
{"type":"message","id":"4e00d204","parentId":"db4628f3","timestamp":"2026-02-18T13:26:12.143Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3ba92fdb197a4005b3c601bc","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"@echo off\r\nREM Force kill any existing node processes to free up ports\r\ntaskkill /F /IM node.exe >nul 2>&1\r\n\r\nREM Launch PowerShell in the current window.\r\nREM We set environment variables to ensure they persist for the node process and across internal restarts.\r\npowershell -NoExit -Command \"$env:OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR = '%~dp0.openclaw'; if (-not $env:OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN) { $env:OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN = 'openclaw' }; node scripts\\run-node.mjs gateway --port 18789 --allow-unconfigured\"\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1771421172139}}
{"type":"message","id":"45c7283e","parentId":"4e00d204","timestamp":"2026-02-18T13:26:21.430Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! The batch file does:\n1. Force kills all node.exe processes\n2. Launches PowerShell with `-NoExit` (keeps window open after command finishes) and runs a command that:\n   - Sets OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR\n   - Sets OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN if not set\n   - Runs `node scripts\\run-node.mjs gateway --port 18789 --allow-unconfigured`\n\nThis is launching the OpenClaw gateway. The `-NoExit` keeps the PowerShell window open, and the window title is likely set by the script inside to \"openclaw-tui\" (or maybe it's default). This batch file is being launched from the desktop shortcut. The flickering suggests that this gateway is crashing and being restarted repeatedly, maybe because the batch file is being run repeatedly or there's a watchdog.\n\nBut wait: The batch file itself is just a one-time launch. If the gateway crashes, the PowerShell window would close (unless -NoExit keeps it open even after the command exits? Actually, -NoExit keeps the PowerShell session open after the command finishes. If the node process crashes, the PowerShell window would remain open with a prompt, not automatically restart. So the flickering suggests that something is repeatedly launching this batch file.\n\nWhat could be launching it repeatedly? Possibly:\n- A scheduled task that runs this batch file (maybe the task name doesn't contain openclaw)\n- A startup entry that runs it, and it crashes and restarts via some watchdog\n- The batch file itself might have a loop? No.\n\nLet's check if there is any scheduled task that runs this batch file. I need to search the scheduled tasks file for paths containing \"launch_openclaw.bat\" or \"openclaw\". We already searched for \"openclaw\" and \"gateway\" and didn't find matches, but maybe the file path contains those words in a different case? We used /i so case-insensitive. But maybe the task uses a different path, like using the openclaw.cmd directly.\n\nLet me search for \"clawdbot\" or \"launch_openclaw\" in the scheduled tasks file.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Let's search the scheduled tasks file for any task that might be running this batch file or the openclaw command:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f557c529420546c1b67769a7","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"findstr /i \"clawdbot launch_openclaw openclaw.cmd gateway 18789\" \"C:\\Users\\mangs\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\all_scheduled_tasks.txt\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":105611,"output":1044,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106655,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771421172144}}
